ry observing check must pass in a merged pull request, and automatic verification completes the task row when its delivery is ready. Alignment converts explicit legacy test plans, distinguishes unreadable plans, and checks References against repository visibility.\n\n## Changes\n\nSync now uses recorded Pass marks to settle criteria and keeps the delivery protocol aligned with those automatic results.\n\n### Criterion Verification\n\n- **Passed evidence settles criteria.**\n  Evidence is scoped to each task's Coverage; incomplete observations and pending deliveries withhold automatic ticks.\n- **Completion reporting drives follow-up.**\n  Automatically verified criteria report as settled, and explicit verification addresses the remaining unticked criteria.\n- **Verification has fixture coverage.**\n  Fifteen fixtures exercise pass marks, missing evidence, multiple tasks and deliveries, scope, readiness, repeat synchronization and reporting.\n\n### Alignment Evidence\n\n- **Explicit plan repair.**\n  Unambiguous checked lists convert to the current evidence table; missing linked results remain pending and each converted pull request is named.\n- **Distinct diagnostics.**\n  Unreadable plans are diagnosed before criterion comparison; private references on public issues and unavailable visibility are reported from repository snapshots.\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [#1266](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1266) — Dependency Rows Read by Task Id.\n- **R2.** [#1289](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1289) — Malformed Task Ids Named.\n- **R3.** [#1467](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1467) — Quiet Columns: An Unresolvable Entry and the Joins Advisory.\n- **R4.** [#1478](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1478) — Passed Checks Verify Epic Criteria.\n\n- **R5.** [#1481](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1481) — Align Test Plans and Reference Visibility.\n- **R6.** [Architecture Overview](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-10-31-1479-test-plan-evidence/architecture-overview.md) — Measured structure, flows and reading order for the current review head.\n\n- **R7.** [Review and verification](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-10-31-1479-test-plan-evidence/review.md) — Both review findings resolved at 84ea700ea; 456 planner tests, 76 shared tests and 49 skill-file checks pass.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-31T07:01:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T08:03:11Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T08:03:11Z","merged_at":"2026-10-31T08:03:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"04de875a8517dcf229462e3b939099e16ffe3e63","assignee":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://